  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mfenced><mn>6</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mfenced><mn>7</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
